    # had them. What differs, and why:
    #  SA. The phase is Milestone 3 part 3 P1: records/logs/m3p3-p1; the script
    #      on the disk in <scripts>, its stderr in <phase>/out, its builds in
    #      <build> (<phase>/test). The base is M3 part 2's close-out record
    #      commit; the doc commit and the three code commits by their full
    #      subjects, beginning "M3 part 3 P1: ", the roles read back to <phase
    #      commit>~4. The previous phase's figures and names are read from
